  m_Name: WizardLoreSO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  LoreTitle: Wizard
  Lore: "I. Despite magic likely being the farthest thing from an exact science,
    humanity has tried to study it as such since its discovery. \n\nIt is no surprise,
    then, that the number of wizards and sorcerers who meet their untimely demise
    greatly outnumber the ones who don't. Succumbing to gruesome deaths in their
    attempts to tame what cannot be tamed, these wizards' names have long since been
    lost to time, leaving behind only their horrific cautionary tales and their discoveries
    paid for in blood."
  LoreText:
  - 
